  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(43, 0, 255);\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(43, 0, 255); transition: all 0.3s ease 0s; text-decoration-line: none; outline-width: 0px; touch-action: manipulation;\" href=\"https://www.chamaripashop.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&nbsp; CMR Chamaripa&reg;</a>,</span>&nbsp;a world-renowned elevator shoe brand which independently designs and produces height increasing shoes for men and women, is popular among consumers in Europe, America, Japan, Korea, and Southeast Asia. We always believe that high-quality shoes not only come from the best materials and considerate customer service, also based on the integrity of the manufacturer.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Each pair of CMR Chamaripa&reg; shoes are hand-crafted, including at least 56 procedures and 46 technicians are involved, a simple shoe-making process is upgraded to an artistic level. We are deeply aware that quality is the cornerstone of CMR Chamaripa&reg;. Wearing our CMR Chamaripa&reg; heightening shoes will immediately increase your height by 2-5 inches, making you more confident and successful.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 45, 45); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 0, 255);\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(43, 0, 255); transition: all 0.3s ease 0s; text-decoration-line: none; outline-width: 0px; touch-action: manipulation;\" href=\"https://www.chamaripashop.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Our shoes</a></span><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 45, 45); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">&nbsp;will invisibly add 1.95- 5.9 inches (5-15cm) in height without losing any comfort. Every pair of our shoes are made with the best care and from high-quality leather. Our full- length height increasing layers are specially designed for each model and size,according to human foot bone structure and the principle of walking mechanics. Featuring with 15-degree proper curve, the height increasing layer is made of light, soft and elastic material, closely fit to the arch of the foot, making you feel strength evenly.As a result, you can wear our shoes on a daily basis without experiencing any discomfort.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 45, 45); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Our shoe last makes it so that the shoes will not slip off, while providing the comfort and room needed for your feet. While adding height, the insoles will help absorb impact and cushion your feet. In every pair of our shoes, there are mid-insoles that help prevent deterioration to the insoles and provide air circulation. Our outer soles help you feel comfortable by allowing a natural instep.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 45, 45); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 45, 45); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">&nbsp; One of the most prominent benefits of elevator shoes is that they look a lot like regular shoes for all intents and purposes. Since the shoes builted -in height increaseing layer, they naturally help the wearer appear taller and improve the posture. Height plays a key role in social interactions and self-confidence. It is normal to want to be on par with friends or co-workers with a few extra inches. This added height might give you the confidence to take more chances and go after different opportunities. Without you even noticing, these elevator shoes might just help change your stance on life. Whats more, these shoes are designed to be comfortable and fashionable, so you do not have to worry about looking out of style. No matter what your sense of style is, there is a CMR Chamaripa&reg; elevator shoe that fits your personality. From loafers to sneakers to boots, these shoes come in a variety of different styles, colors, and sizes.</span> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): </span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 45, 45); font-family: Poppins; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">&nbsp; We can custom make shoes according to you special request with additional charge.You can change height , color, materials, or out-sole on a particular style, add your name or logo on the shoes, even provide pictures to make normal shoes into elevator shoes. The charge varies from different situation,please contact our customer service if needed.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Poppins; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(49, 45, 45); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 18pt;\">This is a screenshot of what our old customers often buy</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px